1
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,799
Look at his jade-like face.

2
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:49,000
Fine features.

3
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,840
A graceful air.

4
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,280
Good appearance.

5
00:01:52,679 --> 00:01:53,799
Dashing charm.

6
00:01:53,959 --> 00:01:55,000
And dignified bearing.

7
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,840
Since when has Shazhou

8
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,360
ever seen such a handsome man?

9
00:01:58,679 --> 00:02:00,239
How elegant even while

10
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,560
eating mutton!

11
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:03,000
Must be from the gentle south.

12
00:02:03,159 --> 00:02:05,079
Like a painting

13
00:02:05,079 --> 00:02:06,719
come to life.

14
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,920
Even gnawing bones, he's refined.

15
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:10,760
Good looks make

16
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,360
any act a pleasure.

17
00:02:12,679 --> 00:02:14,040
I'll go invite him for a drink.

18
00:02:14,239 --> 00:02:14,920
Let me do it.

19
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:16,160
Me!

20
00:02:16,399 --> 00:02:17,200
Me!

21
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:18,559
Me!

22
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:19,679
Me!

23
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,440
Bring my finest grape wine

24
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,279
for this young master.

25
00:02:36,799 --> 00:02:38,399
Here's to you, sir.

26
00:02:38,959 --> 00:02:39,880
Ladies.

27
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:40,799
After you.

28
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:43,799
Stop there.

29
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:49,999
No need to continue.

30
00:02:53,959 --> 00:02:54,799
Ms. Yan.

31
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,200
I was blind to help

32
00:02:58,200 --> 00:02:59,160
Jiang Mei'er before.

33
00:02:59,239 --> 00:02:59,920
Could you ask your

34
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:01,200
father not to cut off our business?

35
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:01,999
My father said

36
00:03:01,999 --> 00:03:02,760
if I can't win

37
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:03,600
your business back,

38
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:05,279
he'll break my legs!

39
00:03:05,279 --> 00:03:06,239
Please, you're a merciful woman!

40
00:03:06,239 --> 00:03:07,679
I beg your forgiveness!

41
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:08,600
Too late.

42
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,279
You should have thought of that

43
00:03:10,279 --> 00:03:11,600
when you helped her.

44
00:03:12,959 --> 00:03:13,679
I was wrong.

45
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:14,999
I didn't recognize your stature.

46
00:03:14,999 --> 00:03:16,239
Please don't leave me to die!

47
00:03:16,239 --> 00:03:17,160
Get out!

48
00:03:17,519 --> 00:03:18,880
Don't disturb my business!

49
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:22,239
Yan Fuzhi!

50
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:23,799
Are you really leaving me to death?

51
00:03:24,279 --> 00:03:25,440
Jiang Mei'er was right.

52
00:03:25,679 --> 00:03:26,200
You're also

53
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:27,480
a venomous woman,

54
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:28,640
just like Meng Tinghui,

55
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:29,320
a wolf that

56
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:30,559
devours people without mercy!

57
00:03:32,679 --> 00:03:33,760
How dare you speak ill of Tinghui?

58
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:35,239
I'll show you what a truly

59
00:03:35,239 --> 00:03:36,640
venomous heart looks like,

60
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,559
and what it means to devour you without mercy!

61
00:03:40,239 --> 00:03:40,880
Get up!

62
00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:46,119
Help!

63
00:03:49,119 --> 00:03:50,119
If you ever set foot in

64
00:03:50,119 --> 00:03:50,959
Bofeng House again,

65
00:03:51,239 --> 00:03:52,600
I'll kick your sorry ass right out!

66
00:04:01,399 --> 00:04:02,119
Back to your meals!

67
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:07,480
Such a pretty girl,

68
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:09,119
yet so fierce and sharp-tongued.

69
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:10,440
Even if you're disciplining

70
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,320
your husband, there's a limit, isn't there?

71
00:04:12,559 --> 00:04:13,880
Who says I'm his wife?

72
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:14,600
He's not worthy.

73
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,399
You're just a handsome face

74
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,480
with no brains.

75
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:19,119
Strutting like a peacock the moment you see a woman.

76
00:04:20,799 --> 00:04:22,279
Those are harsh words, miss.

77
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:25,160
I was only trying to mediate.

78
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,799
But with a temper like yours,

79
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:27,999
no wonder that gentleman

80
00:04:27,999 --> 00:04:28,960
would rather take a beating

81
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:30,199
than marry you.

82
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,239
You!

83
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:32,639
You get out too!

84
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:33,439
Whether I marry or not

85
00:04:33,439 --> 00:04:34,439
is none of your business,

86
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:35,239
you lecherous fool

87
00:04:35,239 --> 00:04:36,080
full of romantic drivel!

88
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:39,520
On what authority?

89
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:43,040
Because I run this place!

90
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:43,960
Now.

91
00:04:44,319 --> 00:04:44,920
Immediately.

92
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:45,679
Out!

93
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:49,439
Get out!

94
00:04:51,999 --> 00:04:52,480
You!

95
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:54,999
Out!

96
00:04:56,119 --> 00:04:57,600
You really are a fiery one.

97
00:04:58,080 --> 00:04:58,759
From now on,

98
00:04:58,759 --> 00:04:59,999
don't set foot in this place again.

99
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,280
And why would I...

100
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,400
Huang?

101
00:05:04,639 --> 00:05:05,520
What are you doing here?

102
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:06,720
The Master sent me to find you.

103
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,480
Hold on.

104
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,600
I need to settle this with her.

105
00:05:08,799 --> 00:05:10,160
She actually hit me with an abacus!

106
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:11,840
Mr. Shen,

107
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,040
you really don't want to mess with her.

108
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,559
She's just a restaurant owner.

109
00:05:16,559 --> 00:05:17,520
What's so special?

110
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,639
She's Meng Tinghui's closest friend.

111
00:05:20,639 --> 00:05:22,759
She even swung a knife at Master.

112
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:25,920
You mean

113
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,639
the Master?

114
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:32,239
Well, at least I can stay out of her way.

115
00:05:32,239 --> 00:05:32,920
Wait for me!

116
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,520
This way, please.

117
00:05:41,239 --> 00:05:42,639
Mr. Shen has arranged

118
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:43,759
your lodgings

119
00:05:43,759 --> 00:05:44,720
in the eastern wing

120
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,080
of the government office.

121
00:05:46,319 --> 00:05:48,160
I'll take you there now.

122
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:52,600
Who is this Mr. Shen

123
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,400
you speak of?

124
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:54,960
That would be me.

125
00:05:57,239 --> 00:05:57,879
Father,

126
00:05:58,119 --> 00:06:00,119
it's your handsome,

127
00:06:00,119 --> 00:06:01,239
charming,

128
00:06:01,239 --> 00:06:02,759
and elegant son,

129
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:03,799
Shen Zhishu.

130
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,439
Zhishu!

131
00:06:08,119 --> 00:06:09,119
My boy's made it!

132
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,639
Come on, spin around.

133
00:06:10,639 --> 00:06:11,799
Let me get a good look at you.

134
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:14,600
What a Mr. Shen!

135
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,879
You've got some nerve!

136
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:17,879
Helping the Emperor slip out of the palace.

137
00:06:17,879 --> 00:06:18,999
You nearly doomed our

138
00:06:18,999 --> 00:06:19,960
entire Shen clan!

139
00:06:20,799 --> 00:06:22,040
I was just serving my lord and

140
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:22,799
sharing his burdens.

141
00:06:22,799 --> 00:06:23,879
Sharing his burdens?

142
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,879
Our family has upheld its honor for generations.

143
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:26,679
How did we end up with

144
00:06:26,679 --> 00:06:28,480
a reckless rogue like you?

145
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:28,920
Father!

146
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:29,920
Stop!

147
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:30,439
Father!

148
00:06:30,439 --> 00:06:31,679
Listen, I'm a titled official now.

149
00:06:31,679 --> 00:06:32,999
Assaulting a court officer

150
00:06:32,999 --> 00:06:33,920
is a crime, you know!

151
00:06:34,239 --> 00:06:35,160
I'll beat you dead first,

152
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,119
then apologize to the late Emperor.

153
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:37,999
Don't run!

154
00:06:37,999 --> 00:06:38,679
Father!

155
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:41,239
I order you to put down that weapon right now!

156
00:06:41,239 --> 00:06:42,199
If you swing too hard

157
00:06:42,199 --> 00:06:42,720
and kill me,

158
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,679
who'll hold your funeral

159
00:06:43,679 --> 00:06:44,239
and see you off?

160
00:06:44,239 --> 00:06:45,920
You dare curse your own father?

161
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,199
So full of yourself now!

162
00:06:47,639 --> 00:06:48,439
Get back here!

163
00:06:48,679 --> 00:06:49,439
Stand still!

164
00:06:49,759 --> 00:06:50,879
I'm so pissed off!

165
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:52,720
Your Majesty,

166
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:53,999
if you don't go out now,

167
00:06:53,999 --> 00:06:55,319
Mr. Shen will be beaten to death.

168
00:06:55,799 --> 00:06:56,679
What's the hurry?

169
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,799
It's been ages since I've witnessed

170
00:06:59,439 --> 00:07:00,280
such a loving

171
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,199
father-son scene.

172
00:07:01,319 --> 00:07:02,119
You unfilial son!

173
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:02,600
Father!

174
00:07:02,679 --> 00:07:03,239
I really...

175
00:07:03,239 --> 00:07:04,559
Still running, are you?

176
00:07:04,559 --> 00:07:05,160
Stop gawking!

177
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:05,799
Come out now,

178
00:07:05,799 --> 00:07:06,999
or I'll be smashed!

179
00:07:06,999 --> 00:07:07,679
Call for help?

180
00:07:07,679 --> 00:07:08,879
I'll take them on too!

181
00:07:11,679 --> 00:07:14,480
Your servant Shen Wuchen kowtows to Your Majesty.

182
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:16,559
Grand Tutor, you're as fierce as ever.

183
00:07:16,799 --> 00:07:18,239
Still no missed swing.

184
00:07:18,439 --> 00:07:19,759
Father, you sure kneel fast.

185
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:20,999
Better at that than hitting me.

186
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:22,319
Rise, Grand Tutor.

187
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,520
This journey

188
00:07:25,679 --> 00:07:26,840
was my own doing.

189
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,480
I ordered Zhishu not to refuse.

190
00:07:28,759 --> 00:07:30,119
If you blame him,

191
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:31,600
I'm the one at fault.

192
00:07:32,759 --> 00:07:34,319
Since Your Majesty speaks for him,

193
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:36,080
I'll let him off this time.

194
00:07:37,119 --> 00:07:37,799
The Shazhou case

195
00:07:37,799 --> 00:07:39,799
was solved with open moves and hidden ones.

196
00:07:40,199 --> 00:07:41,920
It's not only cleared corruption in military supplies,

197
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:43,759
but also served as a clever counterbalance against

198
00:07:43,759 --> 00:07:44,840
the Grand Chancellor.

199
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,319
I see the late Emperor's

200
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:48,199
spirit in you once more.

201
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:49,480
You flatter me.

202
00:07:50,879 --> 00:07:52,639
I've watched closely.

203
00:07:52,679 --> 00:07:54,520
The court is tense.

204
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:57,480
Your Majesty has few

205
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,360
reliable allies.

206
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,799
Building trusted circles

207
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:00,999
can't wait.

208
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,759
Left Vice Minister of War, Pei Jinghe

209
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:05,280
is capable, shrewd, upright.

210
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:07,360
Yet he's sidelined for opposing

211
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,439
Liu Ren's overreach

212
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:09,920
and still idle.

213
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:13,199
He's ready for Your Majesty's call.

214
00:08:13,799 --> 00:08:15,679
You're out of court,

215
00:08:16,119 --> 00:08:18,080
yet see it clear as day.

216
00:08:18,119 --> 00:08:19,400
The realm is a chessboard;

217
00:08:19,559 --> 00:08:20,639
the sovereign, the player.

218
00:08:20,999 --> 00:08:22,439
Though removed from court,

219
00:08:22,439 --> 00:08:24,199
I'm still Your Majesty's piece

220
00:08:24,639 --> 00:08:25,960
for the country's stability.

221
00:08:26,559 --> 00:08:27,960
Today, Chancellor controls

222
00:08:28,119 --> 00:08:29,799
four of the six ministries.

223
00:08:30,879 --> 00:08:31,999
Every talent from

224
00:08:31,999 --> 00:08:33,119
the civil exams

225
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,439
has become

226
00:08:34,439 --> 00:08:35,439
his protégé.

227
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:38,280
I now have no choice but to seek talent

228
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:39,960
from the women's

229
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,039
imperial examination,

230
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,600
a path he refuses to touch.

231
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,119
Your Majesty.

232
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:49,680
One more word.

233
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:53,159
Every emperor has his own court.

234
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,759
The two chancellors are

235
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:55,800
gaining power fast.

236
00:08:56,119 --> 00:08:57,600
If they join hands,

237
00:08:57,999 --> 00:08:59,399
you'll have trouble holding your own.

238
00:09:00,159 --> 00:09:02,159
The Left Chancellor's overreach

239
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:04,279
has already angered the other.

240
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,999
Use that to your advantage.

241
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,440
No need for me

242
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:12,800
to lecture you on the art of balance.

243
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:22,440
Was this painting excluded from the top rank

244
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:24,119
because of weak brushwork?

245
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:25,519
Not quite.

246
00:09:25,919 --> 00:09:27,119
It only depicts still objects

247
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,360
and lacks life.

248
00:09:30,519 --> 00:09:31,320
I disagree.

249
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:33,519
Zhili, you're here.

250
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:50,759
Master.

251
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:59,639
This painting shows a scene at dusk in late spring.

252
00:10:00,119 --> 00:10:01,999
But the plants, trees,

253
00:10:01,999 --> 00:10:02,960
clouds, and mist

254
00:10:03,399 --> 00:10:04,800
are all too bright and showy.

255
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,759
That robs it of its sense of reality.

256
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:08,080
When a painting loses truth,

257
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,480
its spirit scatters.

258
00:10:10,399 --> 00:10:11,360
When a person loses truth,

259
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:12,720
they're hollow inside.

260
00:10:13,879 --> 00:10:15,440
Zhili, have a seat.

261
00:10:18,159 --> 00:10:19,279
Zhili truly understands

262
00:10:19,279 --> 00:10:20,560
master's mind best.

263
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,759
Quick-witted and sharp,

264
00:10:22,879 --> 00:10:24,440
and blessed with such a gift.

265
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:26,080
With your learning, in this

266
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,639
special women's examination,

267
00:10:27,919 --> 00:10:28,800
passing is the least of it,

268
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,360
taking top honors

269
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:31,560
is well within reach.

270
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:35,320
You passed the palace exam back then,

271
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:36,480
and upon joining the Ministry of Works,

272
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:37,840
your essay On Water Management

273
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,800
caused quite a stir at court.

274
00:10:39,239 --> 00:10:40,039
Once put into practice,

275
00:10:40,039 --> 00:10:41,759
it solved the flooding in South

276
00:10:41,759 --> 00:10:42,879
and relieved the people's suffering.

277
00:10:43,039 --> 00:10:44,399
I wish to follow you

278
00:10:44,399 --> 00:10:45,279
into office

279
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,560
and share your burdens.

280
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:49,200
But yesterday my father told me

281
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:50,159
Chancellor Xu

282
00:10:50,159 --> 00:10:51,519
strongly opposes the women's examination.

283
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:52,960
Even if we pass,

284
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:54,279
we can't hold rank above sixth grade.

285
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,279
So I fear

286
00:10:55,519 --> 00:10:56,800
we'll have little chance

287
00:10:57,159 --> 00:10:58,360
to put our talents to use.

288
00:11:02,039 --> 00:11:03,480
Talent has nothing to do with

289
00:11:03,639 --> 00:11:04,600
looks or gender.

290
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:06,039
His Majesty pushed this through

291
00:11:06,039 --> 00:11:07,320
despite opposition, which is

292
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,840
a clear proof of his will

293
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:09,759
to recruit true talent.

294
00:11:10,039 --> 00:11:11,480
When you enter court in the future,

295
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,279
I will do everything I can

296
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,800
to support you.

297
00:11:18,560 --> 00:11:19,759
Master, you are indeed a worthy chancellor,

298
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,200
bringing fortune to the people,

299
00:11:21,639 --> 00:11:22,720
opening paths for the humble,

300
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:24,039
and vindicating women.

301
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,480
Your integrity has never

302
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:26,800
fallen short of Chancellor Xu's.

303
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:29,159
Yet he has roots in three courts

304
00:11:29,519 --> 00:11:30,759
and control over four ministries.

305
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:33,680
I truly feel wronged for you.

306
00:11:33,759 --> 00:11:35,759
I have never cared for rank or power.

307
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:37,360
I have always been loyal.

308
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:38,759
Even if His Majesty grants all

309
00:11:38,759 --> 00:11:40,360
six ministries to Chancellor Xu,

310
00:11:40,919 --> 00:11:42,360
I bear no grudge.

311
00:11:43,519 --> 00:11:45,119
I only grieve that

312
00:11:45,759 --> 00:11:46,320
the world knows

313
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:48,039
of Chancellor Xu's virtue,

314
00:11:48,759 --> 00:11:50,759
but not the Emperor's wisdom.

315
00:11:51,399 --> 00:11:53,680
All praise a wise chancellor as rare.

316
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:56,039
Only you truly live up to the name.

317
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:02,759
I shall support His Majesty

318
00:12:03,039 --> 00:12:04,080
in forging a new path.

319
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:05,879
Then women too

320
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:07,399
may stand with dignity

321
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,480
at court.

322
00:12:11,239 --> 00:12:13,119
We will always hold

323
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,960
your great vision in our hearts.

324
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,519
Zhao Chunnuan?

325
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:22,360
Here.

326
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:26,519
Xie Yunxi?

327
00:12:26,879 --> 00:12:27,519
Present.

328
00:12:28,759 --> 00:12:29,440
Tinghui,

329
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:30,560
did you see that?

330
00:12:30,999 --> 00:12:32,080
She just took

331
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,560
a whole box of ink.

332
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:36,999
Are you here to keep my company

333
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,759
or just to watch the show?

334
00:12:39,519 --> 00:12:40,639
I'm here to cheer on my

335
00:12:40,639 --> 00:12:41,560
Tinghui, of course!

336
00:12:41,879 --> 00:12:42,919
Last night I dreamed you

337
00:12:42,919 --> 00:12:44,480
topped the list!

338
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,800
It literally woke me up laughing.

339
00:12:48,039 --> 00:12:48,800
Fuzhi!

340
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,320
Then I couldn't get back to sleep,

341
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:51,960
so I got up

342
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:52,919
and made you some

343
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:53,879
apricot cakes.

344
00:12:53,879 --> 00:12:54,600
They're right here.

345
00:12:58,399 --> 00:12:59,320
Oh, I forgot them.

346
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,560
I'll have them when we get back.

347
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:03,960
Meng Tinghui?

348
00:13:04,519 --> 00:13:05,119
Here.

349
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:08,680
You go wait for me at home.

350
00:13:08,759 --> 00:13:09,720
I'll stay right here with you.

351
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:10,399
I'm not going anywhere.

352
00:13:10,519 --> 00:13:11,080
Don't worry.

353
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,039
You're the best.

354
00:13:12,039 --> 00:13:12,960
No need to be nervous.

355
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:13,840
You'll nail this

356
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:14,360
provincial exam.

357
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:15,800
Fuzhi,

358
00:13:16,399 --> 00:13:17,680
if you keep talking, I'll get dizzy.

359
00:13:17,680 --> 00:13:18,360
Okay, I'll stop.

360
00:13:20,399 --> 00:13:21,879
Meng Tinghui?

361
00:13:31,759 --> 00:13:32,399
Tinghui!

362
00:13:45,759 --> 00:13:47,840
The provincial exam begins.

363
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:12,239
We've reached Jingdu's boundary.

364
00:15:12,239 --> 00:15:12,800
Your Majesty.

365
00:15:13,399 --> 00:15:14,320
Return to the palace, now.

366
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:14,840
Yes.

367
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,080
Follow me.

368
00:15:35,239 --> 00:15:36,200
Welcome, Your Majesty.

369
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:38,279
I've been waiting here for some time.

370
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:39,399
Thank you, Chancellor Gu.

371
00:16:06,279 --> 00:16:07,119
Today is the day

372
00:16:07,119 --> 00:16:08,680
His Majesty comes out of retreat.

373
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:10,200
It's already noon,

374
00:16:10,519 --> 00:16:10,919
yet

375
00:16:10,919 --> 00:16:12,320
there's still no sign of him?

376
00:16:12,639 --> 00:16:13,279
Strange.

377
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:14,879
Even Chancellor Gu hasn't arrived.

378
00:16:15,279 --> 00:16:15,999
Silence!

379
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:23,759
How dare you make such noise

380
00:16:24,399 --> 00:16:26,119
before the Ancestral Hall!

381
00:16:43,039 --> 00:16:45,879
His Majesty's retreat is a major event.

382
00:16:46,279 --> 00:16:48,680
How could a Chancellor be late?

383
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,399
What a disgrace!

384
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:53,560
You are absolutely right.

385
00:16:58,759 --> 00:16:59,879
[Last night, my scouts]

386
00:16:59,879 --> 00:17:02,039
[clearly saw the imperial carriage return to the palace.]

387
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:03,680
[Could it be...]

388
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:28,760
His Majesty has already completed his retreat.

389
00:17:29,679 --> 00:17:31,760
Your Majesty.

390
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:34,760
May Your Majesty enjoy boundless blessings.

391
00:17:35,760 --> 00:17:37,119
All ministers, rise.

392
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:46,080
Chancellor Xu, your temples

393
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:47,800
have gained a few more white strands.

394
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:50,719
It seems that during my ten days of retreat,

395
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:52,959
you have labored greatly in

396
00:17:53,399 --> 00:17:56,000
governing the state.

397
00:17:56,840 --> 00:17:59,080
I am merely fulfilling my duties.

398
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:02,199
Such trivial affairs are hardly worth

399
00:18:02,199 --> 00:18:03,399
mentioning compared to

400
00:18:03,399 --> 00:18:05,479
Your Majesty's retreat, in which you contemplate

401
00:18:05,479 --> 00:18:06,800
the great way of governance.

402
00:18:08,040 --> 00:18:09,360
Chancellor Xu, do you know

403
00:18:09,719 --> 00:18:11,240
what I have been contemplating?

404
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:14,240
I have been privileged to serve in three courts,

405
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:16,040
and I have some modest insight

406
00:18:16,399 --> 00:18:17,879
into court affairs.

407
00:18:18,399 --> 00:18:20,439
I venture to guess that

408
00:18:20,439 --> 00:18:21,679
Your Majesty's retreat

409
00:18:22,520 --> 00:18:23,479
must have been devoted to

410
00:18:23,479 --> 00:18:26,439
meditating on the late Emperor's governing strategies.

411
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:30,119
As a veteran of three courts,

412
00:18:30,959 --> 00:18:32,600
you truly understand my heart.

413
00:18:36,560 --> 00:18:37,479
Your Majesty,

414
00:18:37,879 --> 00:18:39,439
an urgent dispatch.

415
00:18:39,520 --> 00:18:40,719
Please peruse it.

416
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:58,320
This is critical.

417
00:18:59,399 --> 00:19:00,199
Steward You,

418
00:19:00,639 --> 00:19:01,520
take the ministers

419
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:02,760
to the main hall and wait.

420
00:19:03,360 --> 00:19:05,119
Chancellor Gu and I will follow shortly.

421
00:19:05,199 --> 00:19:05,840
Yes, Your Majesty.

422
00:19:35,399 --> 00:19:37,399
Snoring loud in the main hall.

423
00:19:37,399 --> 00:19:38,399
How disgraceful!

424
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:41,080
It's past the third watch.

425
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:42,840
Tea's been refilled thrice.

426
00:19:43,119 --> 00:19:44,760
When will His Majesty arrive?

427
00:19:45,199 --> 00:19:46,040
Ministers,

428
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:47,199
be patient.

429
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:48,879
His Majesty will be here soon.

430
00:19:49,919 --> 00:19:50,760
Chancellor Xu,

431
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:52,800
His Majesty, mindful of your age,

432
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:54,679
has granted you an armchair.

433
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:28,639
Gu Qin,

434
00:20:28,959 --> 00:20:31,399
what matter keeps you clinging to His Majesty?

435
00:20:32,040 --> 00:20:34,760
Your Majesty arrives!

436
00:21:03,600 --> 00:21:04,520
Thank you, Your Majesty.

437
00:21:34,840 --> 00:21:36,280
My ministers, you have toiled late

438
00:21:36,280 --> 00:21:37,399
into the night on state affairs.

439
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:38,879
I am grateful.

440
00:21:39,399 --> 00:21:41,080
I spent ten days in retreat,

441
00:21:41,320 --> 00:21:43,080
while Chancellor Xu managed the government.

442
00:21:43,840 --> 00:21:45,800
I have prepared a special gift for you.

443
00:21:45,919 --> 00:21:46,800
Let it be read!

444
00:22:00,560 --> 00:22:02,560
Your Majesty, what is the meaning of this?

445
00:22:02,560 --> 00:22:03,760
Do you know that

446
00:22:03,760 --> 00:22:05,639
your prized protégé Ding Chong,

447
00:22:06,399 --> 00:22:07,879
using your personally inscribed plaque

448
00:22:07,879 --> 00:22:08,959
as a talisman,

449
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:11,320
deceived superiors and oppressed the people in Shazhou,

450
00:22:11,320 --> 00:22:12,520
corrupt, tyrannical,

451
00:22:12,520 --> 00:22:13,879
and high-handed?

452
00:22:14,080 --> 00:22:14,719
Your Majesty,

453
00:22:15,040 --> 00:22:16,439
Ding Chong told me himself

454
00:22:16,439 --> 00:22:17,080
that he has

455
00:22:17,080 --> 00:22:18,679
long enjoyed your protection.

456
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:21,360
These are all his crimes.

457
00:22:23,919 --> 00:22:24,639
Absurd!

458
00:22:25,080 --> 00:22:26,560
Collusion between officials and bandits?

459
00:22:26,560 --> 00:22:27,639
Trafficking military equipment?

460
00:22:28,479 --> 00:22:29,879
I knew nothing of

461
00:22:30,080 --> 00:22:31,719
his deeds!

462
00:22:31,959 --> 00:22:33,479
How can you speak of my protection?

463
00:22:33,600 --> 00:22:35,119
But was not that plaque inscribed

464
00:22:35,119 --> 00:22:36,760
by your own hand?

465
00:22:37,240 --> 00:22:38,280
I can see clearly.

466
00:22:38,560 --> 00:22:39,320
The calligraphy

467
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:41,119
is yours.

468
00:22:46,719 --> 00:22:48,000
Your Majesty, hear me clearly.

469
00:22:48,639 --> 00:22:50,800
The Chancellor Xu's protégés are spread across the country,

470
00:22:50,800 --> 00:22:51,919
so it's inevitable that some corrupt officials

471
00:22:51,919 --> 00:22:53,000
might misuse his inscriptions.

472
00:22:53,240 --> 00:22:54,199
That's not something

473
00:22:54,199 --> 00:22:56,119
he could have foreseen.

474
00:22:57,199 --> 00:22:59,000
Moreover, Shazhou is a remote border region.

475
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:00,439
Chancellor Xu has labored tirelessly

476
00:23:00,439 --> 00:23:01,159
for Your Majesty

477
00:23:01,159 --> 00:23:02,159
and the state.

478
00:23:02,159 --> 00:23:03,199
Ding falsified his achievements.

479
00:23:03,199 --> 00:23:05,040
That is beyond the Chancellor Xu's control.

480
00:23:07,199 --> 00:23:07,840
Your Majesty,

481
00:23:08,119 --> 00:23:09,240
I oversee the Ministry of War.

482
00:23:09,479 --> 00:23:11,000
I let a treacherous official like Ding

483
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:11,840
slip through.

484
00:23:11,840 --> 00:23:13,320
I neglected my oversight.

485
00:23:13,399 --> 00:23:14,399
The fault is mine alone.

486
00:23:14,639 --> 00:23:16,000
Chancellor Xu bears no blame.

487
00:23:16,240 --> 00:23:18,240
I only asked one question,

488
00:23:18,719 --> 00:23:20,199
and you all leap to

489
00:23:20,199 --> 00:23:21,479
his defense.

490
00:23:21,719 --> 00:23:23,439
Am I wrong,

491
00:23:23,439 --> 00:23:25,879
or is he above questioning?

492
00:23:25,879 --> 00:23:26,399
Your Majesty,

493
00:23:26,399 --> 00:23:28,280
I have served in three courts.

494
00:23:28,560 --> 00:23:30,439
My loyalty is witnessed by all.

495
00:23:31,119 --> 00:23:32,280
Even this leg,

496
00:23:32,719 --> 00:23:34,439
injured when I shielded

497
00:23:34,479 --> 00:23:36,199
the late Emperor from bandits,

498
00:23:36,280 --> 00:23:37,360
bears the scar of my devotion.

499
00:23:38,360 --> 00:23:40,560
I rely on my unyielding loyalty

500
00:23:40,639 --> 00:23:41,879
and hard-won achievements

501
00:23:42,080 --> 00:23:43,399
to command the respect of the court.

502
00:23:43,760 --> 00:23:44,879
But Your Majesty,

503
00:23:45,159 --> 00:23:46,280
who has misled you during your time

504
00:23:46,600 --> 00:23:48,159
in Shazhou, and what slanderous whispers

505
00:23:48,520 --> 00:23:50,399
have clouded your judgment,

506
00:23:50,520 --> 00:23:51,919
that you now harbor such

507
00:23:51,919 --> 00:23:53,679
dissatisfaction and suspicion toward me?

508
00:23:54,320 --> 00:23:56,760
Chancellor Xu, surely you are mistaken.

509
00:23:57,600 --> 00:23:58,560
I have spent the past ten days

510
00:23:58,560 --> 00:24:00,679
in seclusion at the Ancestral Hall,

511
00:24:00,879 --> 00:24:02,320
fasting and reflecting on governance.

512
00:24:02,320 --> 00:24:04,119
When did I ever go to Shazhou?

513
00:24:06,479 --> 00:24:07,280
It seems that Your Majesty,

514
00:24:07,280 --> 00:24:09,040
having visited that wild frontier,

515
00:24:09,439 --> 00:24:11,080
has picked up quite a talent

516
00:24:11,399 --> 00:24:13,080
for playing the rogue.

517
00:24:13,360 --> 00:24:14,360
I recall now.

518
00:24:14,800 --> 00:24:17,360
I did visit Shazhou ten years ago.

519
00:24:17,879 --> 00:24:18,879
Perhaps

520
00:24:18,879 --> 00:24:20,719
you've confused old tales.

521
00:24:20,719 --> 00:24:21,879
I have a witness!

522
00:24:21,879 --> 00:24:23,080
Name him.

523
00:24:23,080 --> 00:24:23,840
It's Shen Zhishu!

524
00:24:23,840 --> 00:24:24,479
Shen?

525
00:24:24,919 --> 00:24:25,919
Have you been to Shazhou?

526
00:24:26,199 --> 00:24:27,080
I have,

527
00:24:27,800 --> 00:24:28,719
Your Majesty.

528
00:24:30,199 --> 00:24:32,320
Acting on your orders, I inspected Shazhou,

529
00:24:32,320 --> 00:24:33,959
witnessed its chaos firsthand,

530
00:24:33,959 --> 00:24:35,879
and brought back evidence against Ding Chong.

531
00:24:36,320 --> 00:24:37,439
Shen Zhishu, how dare you!

532
00:24:37,800 --> 00:24:39,080
That night in the Ancestral Hall,

533
00:24:39,080 --> 00:24:40,040
you impersonated His Majesty.

534
00:24:40,399 --> 00:24:41,879
It was I who sent you to Shazhou

535
00:24:41,879 --> 00:24:43,000
to retrieve His Majesty!

536
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:44,320
Chancellor Xu, choose your words.

537
00:24:44,520 --> 00:24:46,439
Trespassing the Ancestral Hall is a grave offense.

538
00:24:46,879 --> 00:24:48,959
Do not add another charge to your list

539
00:24:48,959 --> 00:24:49,919
just to smear me

540
00:24:50,360 --> 00:24:52,159
and Shen Zhishu.

541
00:24:52,159 --> 00:24:52,959
Your Majesty, please.

542
00:24:53,360 --> 00:24:55,000
Chancellor Xu is advanced in years.

543
00:24:55,280 --> 00:24:57,479
Mistakes of memory are only natural.

544
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:04,040
So this entire journey

545
00:25:04,119 --> 00:25:06,919
was a trap set for me.

546
00:25:07,199 --> 00:25:08,760
Chancellor Xu, you are mistaken.

547
00:25:09,040 --> 00:25:09,719
Your Majesty,

548
00:25:09,719 --> 00:25:11,119
I have investigated this matter for a long time

549
00:25:11,119 --> 00:25:12,119
and obtained solid evidence.

550
00:25:12,399 --> 00:25:13,719
Wang Qi, the military governor

551
00:25:13,719 --> 00:25:14,719
of Shazhou, defied regulations,

552
00:25:15,280 --> 00:25:16,560
bypassed General Gao Meng,

553
00:25:16,800 --> 00:25:18,560
and secretly colluded with Minister of War, Liu Ren.

554
00:25:18,560 --> 00:25:20,159
They embezzled 300,000 taels of military funds.

555
00:25:20,479 --> 00:25:21,439
Wang Qi and Gao Meng

556
00:25:21,439 --> 00:25:22,879
are waiting outside the hall

557
00:25:23,080 --> 00:25:24,760
to confront Minister Liu in court,

558
00:25:24,760 --> 00:25:25,760
so that the truth may be seen.

559
00:25:26,159 --> 00:25:26,719
Summon them.

560
00:25:26,729 --> 00:25:27,600
Summon them.

561
00:25:30,919 --> 00:25:33,360
Your Majesty, we confess our crime.

562
00:25:36,040 --> 00:25:36,679
Your Majesty.

563
00:25:37,719 --> 00:25:38,879
I was foolish for a moment.

564
00:25:39,080 --> 00:25:40,040
I know I deserve death.

565
00:25:40,159 --> 00:25:41,199
I beg for mercy!

566
00:25:41,360 --> 00:25:42,040
Your Majesty,

567
00:25:42,439 --> 00:25:43,840
have mercy!

568
00:25:45,280 --> 00:25:46,119
Chancellor Xu.

569
00:25:46,520 --> 00:25:48,119
Liu Ren held a pivotal post

570
00:25:48,119 --> 00:25:49,639
yet conspired with frontier generals,

571
00:25:49,639 --> 00:25:52,199
embezzling funds and compromising military affairs.

572
00:25:52,639 --> 00:25:54,399
With both witnesses and evidence at hand,

573
00:25:55,040 --> 00:25:56,840
how should he be punished under the law?

574
00:25:57,040 --> 00:25:57,959
Your Majesty,

575
00:25:58,520 --> 00:25:59,639
according to the Code,

576
00:26:00,119 --> 00:26:01,240
he shall receive a hundred lashes,

577
00:26:01,479 --> 00:26:03,520
be dismissed, and have his property confiscated.

578
00:26:03,679 --> 00:26:05,360
However, in consideration of his years of service...

579
00:26:05,360 --> 00:26:06,040
Approved.

580
00:26:06,879 --> 00:26:08,800
Follow Chancellor Xu's proposal.

581
00:26:09,080 --> 00:26:11,360
Strip Liu Ren of his post immediately.

582
00:26:11,679 --> 00:26:12,959
Wang Qi, as military governor,

583
00:26:12,959 --> 00:26:13,879
trafficked weapons

584
00:26:14,119 --> 00:26:15,439
and bribed court officials.

585
00:26:15,439 --> 00:26:16,439
Sentence him to immediate execution.

586
00:26:16,959 --> 00:26:19,159
General Gao Meng, though not the principal offender,

587
00:26:19,159 --> 00:26:20,520
failed in oversight

588
00:26:20,520 --> 00:26:21,760
and cannot escape blame.

589
00:26:21,760 --> 00:26:22,800
Demote him one rank,

590
00:26:23,040 --> 00:26:24,679
and let him serve in the army to redeem himself.

591
00:26:24,800 --> 00:26:25,760
All other officials in

592
00:26:25,760 --> 00:26:27,840
this case, both in the military and the Ministry

593
00:26:27,840 --> 00:26:29,280
must be thoroughly investigated.

594
00:26:29,800 --> 00:26:31,719
No leniency.

595
00:26:45,479 --> 00:26:46,159
Your Majesty,

596
00:26:46,439 --> 00:26:47,600
the post of Minister of War

597
00:26:47,600 --> 00:26:49,000
touches on the very foundation of the state.

598
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:49,719
It cannot remain vacant.

599
00:26:50,040 --> 00:26:50,639
In my view,

600
00:26:50,639 --> 00:26:52,000
Left Vice Minister of War Pei Jinghe,

601
00:26:52,119 --> 00:26:54,080
a man of talent, selected by examination,

602
00:26:54,320 --> 00:26:56,280
was sidelined as Military Supply Supervisor

603
00:26:56,280 --> 00:26:57,199
solely because he

604
00:26:57,479 --> 00:26:58,240
opposed

605
00:26:58,240 --> 00:27:00,040
Liu Ren's high-handed ways.

606
00:27:00,040 --> 00:27:00,959
He has been idle ever since.

607
00:27:01,199 --> 00:27:02,199
Issue the decree at once.

608
00:27:02,439 --> 00:27:03,800
Recall him back to Jingdu,

609
00:27:03,919 --> 00:27:05,719
and appoint him Acting Minister of War.

610
00:27:05,919 --> 00:27:06,600
Your Majesty,

611
00:27:06,879 --> 00:27:08,119
the post of Minister of War

612
00:27:08,119 --> 00:27:09,159
bears grave responsibility.

613
00:27:09,360 --> 00:27:10,719
Such a hasty appointment

614
00:27:10,959 --> 00:27:12,360
may be ill-advised.

615
00:27:12,639 --> 00:27:14,760
Then let Chancellor Gu personally oversee him.

616
00:27:15,080 --> 00:27:17,040
Share credit for success and blame for failure.

617
00:27:17,119 --> 00:27:19,360
We shall work as one and

618
00:27:19,520 --> 00:27:20,800
not fail Your Majesty's trust.

619
00:27:21,320 --> 00:27:21,919
Good.

620
00:27:26,760 --> 00:27:28,320
So be it.

621
00:27:28,639 --> 00:27:29,639
My ministers,

622
00:27:30,199 --> 00:27:30,560
you'd best

623
00:27:30,560 --> 00:27:32,320
keep yourselves sharp.

624
00:27:33,199 --> 00:27:35,479
There will be many more late-night court sessions

625
00:27:36,560 --> 00:27:37,800
like this.

626
00:27:38,439 --> 00:27:38,879
Your Majesty.

627
00:27:38,879 --> 00:27:40,080
We see His Majesty out.

628
00:27:40,439 --> 00:27:42,199
We see His Majesty out.

629
00:27:51,240 --> 00:27:52,439
To celebrate her good friend

630
00:27:52,439 --> 00:27:54,240
Meng Tinghui winning the top spot in the exam,

631
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:55,919
Ms. Yan is handing out free porridge for three days.

632
00:28:01,760 --> 00:28:03,280
Plenty for everyone, don't rush.

633
00:28:05,439 --> 00:28:06,040
Here you go.

634
00:28:06,760 --> 00:28:07,479
Slow down.

635
00:28:08,040 --> 00:28:09,040
Everyone gets some.

636
00:28:11,760 --> 00:28:12,600
It's cold out,

637
00:28:12,600 --> 00:28:13,760
so she's also prepared

638
00:28:13,760 --> 00:28:14,879
some herbal remedy.

639
00:28:14,879 --> 00:28:15,800
Have a cup,

640
00:28:15,800 --> 00:28:17,280
keep the chill away.

641
00:28:17,439 --> 00:28:18,080
Here, take it.

642
00:28:18,080 --> 00:28:19,240
She's a true benefactor!

643
00:28:19,240 --> 00:28:19,840
Thank you.

644
00:28:24,879 --> 00:28:25,520
Father!

645
00:28:28,119 --> 00:28:28,840
Careful!

646
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:30,760
It's Meng Tinghui who passed,

647
00:28:30,760 --> 00:28:31,679
not you!

648
00:28:31,679 --> 00:28:32,520
And you have the mood

649
00:28:32,520 --> 00:28:33,560
to put on a front for her?

650
00:28:33,560 --> 00:28:34,800
How embarrassing!

651
00:28:34,800 --> 00:28:35,639
I'm ashamed for you!

652
00:28:35,879 --> 00:28:36,639
Come home with me now!

653
00:28:38,760 --> 00:28:40,280
Now that Bofeng House is profitable,

654
00:28:40,479 --> 00:28:41,879
I can do whatever I want.

655
00:28:41,879 --> 00:28:43,639
I'll send Tinghui to Jingdu for the further exams

656
00:28:43,639 --> 00:28:45,000
and open up new trade routes there.

657
00:28:45,119 --> 00:28:46,919
You're going with her to Jingdu?

658
00:28:48,399 --> 00:28:49,199
You're

659
00:28:49,199 --> 00:28:50,520
completely bewitched!

660
00:28:50,639 --> 00:28:52,360
I've raised a daughter for nothing.

661
00:28:53,080 --> 00:28:53,919
My dear,

662
00:28:55,159 --> 00:28:56,800
Fuzhi may be a girl,

663
00:28:57,119 --> 00:28:58,639
but she has her own mind.

664
00:28:58,919 --> 00:29:00,719
Don't listen to those gossiping old women saying

665
00:29:00,800 --> 00:29:01,959
a woman who shows her face in public

666
00:29:01,959 --> 00:29:03,040
won't find a husband.

667
00:29:03,320 --> 00:29:04,159
Fuzhi.

668
00:29:04,360 --> 00:29:05,600
Even if you never marry,

669
00:29:05,600 --> 00:29:07,040
we can still support you.

670
00:29:07,040 --> 00:29:08,159
Never marry?

671
00:29:08,600 --> 00:29:09,879
So she's going to spend her

672
00:29:09,879 --> 00:29:11,439
whole life with that Meng Tinghui?

673
00:29:11,919 --> 00:29:13,719
Parents decide, matchmakers arrange.

674
00:29:14,119 --> 00:29:15,919
I say who she marries, and that's that!

675
00:29:16,719 --> 00:29:17,600
Fuzhi,

676
00:29:18,520 --> 00:29:19,399
I'll talk to your father

677
00:29:19,520 --> 00:29:21,199
about your marriage.

678
00:29:22,959 --> 00:29:24,360
Don't keep arguing with him.

679
00:29:28,040 --> 00:29:28,719
My dear!

680
00:29:30,080 --> 00:29:30,719
Dear?

681
00:29:34,639 --> 00:29:35,600
- My dear.
- My dear.

682
00:29:35,919 --> 00:29:36,639
Are you alright?

683
00:29:36,919 --> 00:29:38,479
I fell on my own.

684
00:29:38,879 --> 00:29:39,760
It wasn't Fuzhi's fault.

685
00:29:40,159 --> 00:29:40,760
After all these years,

686
00:29:40,760 --> 00:29:41,919
your knack for framing others

687
00:29:41,919 --> 00:29:43,399
hasn't changed one bit.

688
00:29:43,479 --> 00:29:44,080
You!

689
00:29:46,320 --> 00:29:47,000
Tinghui!

690
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:48,439
Meng Tinghui!

691
00:29:48,800 --> 00:29:50,199
You dare stop me?

692
00:29:50,520 --> 00:29:51,199
- You dare?
- I...

693
00:29:52,280 --> 00:29:53,280
I'm now a provincial graduate.

694
00:29:53,439 --> 00:29:54,959
I don't even have to bow to a prefect.

695
00:29:55,119 --> 00:29:56,399
Are you sure you want to strike

696
00:29:56,600 --> 00:29:57,959
a court-recognized scholar?

697
00:29:57,959 --> 00:29:59,560
The whole Shazhou will talk.

698
00:30:00,040 --> 00:30:00,639
I,

699
00:30:01,199 --> 00:30:02,560
I can't control you,

700
00:30:02,959 --> 00:30:04,760
but I can control my daughter.

701
00:30:05,320 --> 00:30:05,840
Guards!

702
00:30:06,199 --> 00:30:07,199
Take her home!

703
00:30:07,360 --> 00:30:07,800
Tinghui!

704
00:30:07,800 --> 00:30:08,439
Hold on.

705
00:30:09,760 --> 00:30:10,439
I've already spoken

706
00:30:10,439 --> 00:30:12,159
with Shazhou's acting commissioner.

707
00:30:12,560 --> 00:30:14,199
Master Yan has been generous.

708
00:30:14,399 --> 00:30:15,679
Three days of free porridge

709
00:30:15,840 --> 00:30:16,919
to celebrate the exam results.

710
00:30:17,520 --> 00:30:18,800
And he has granted his daughter permission

711
00:30:18,959 --> 00:30:20,199
to accompany me to the capital.

712
00:30:20,800 --> 00:30:22,439
Absolute nonsense!

713
00:30:33,119 --> 00:30:34,479
We're here on the commissioner's orders

714
00:30:34,639 --> 00:30:36,879
to congratulate Meng Tinghui on the success.

715
00:30:37,280 --> 00:30:38,360
I, Meng Tinghui,

716
00:30:38,560 --> 00:30:39,560
thank the commissioner.

717
00:30:39,800 --> 00:30:41,439
The commissioner also sends this ceremonial silk

718
00:30:41,439 --> 00:30:42,760
to honor the Yan family,

719
00:30:43,000 --> 00:30:45,040
a tribute to the father and daughter's integrity.

720
00:30:50,119 --> 00:30:51,360
Much obliged.

721
00:30:51,919 --> 00:30:53,040
Thank you.

722
00:30:53,199 --> 00:30:53,879
Thank you.

723
00:30:54,000 --> 00:30:55,080
Meng Tinghui...

724
00:30:55,959 --> 00:30:57,040
you win.

725
00:30:57,439 --> 00:30:58,560
Thank you, Madam Yan.

726
00:30:59,600 --> 00:31:00,879
Please convey to the Commissioner

727
00:31:01,119 --> 00:31:02,320
that Madam Yan just said

728
00:31:02,439 --> 00:31:03,520
she is willing to copy

729
00:31:03,520 --> 00:31:04,520
a thousand...

730
00:31:04,520 --> 00:31:05,280
No, ten thousand.

731
00:31:05,280 --> 00:31:07,280
Ten thousand copies of the Infinite Life Sutra for me and Fuzhi,

732
00:31:07,560 --> 00:31:08,959
to pray for a safe journey

733
00:31:08,959 --> 00:31:09,800
to the capital.

734
00:31:10,520 --> 00:31:11,360
Nonsense!

735
00:31:25,719 --> 00:31:26,800
Thank you, Master Yan.

736
00:31:33,879 --> 00:31:35,560
Thank you, kind benefactor.

737
00:31:35,560 --> 00:31:36,080
Tinghui.

738
00:31:36,080 --> 00:31:37,119
I'm so lucky!

739
00:31:37,119 --> 00:31:37,600
Now I can go to

740
00:31:37,600 --> 00:31:38,919
Jingdu with you!

741
00:31:40,280 --> 00:31:41,159
That banner, I had it

742
00:31:41,159 --> 00:31:41,800
sent in advance

743
00:31:41,800 --> 00:31:43,240
through the Commissioner.

744
00:31:43,479 --> 00:31:45,240
I knew your father and stepmother

745
00:31:45,240 --> 00:31:46,320
would try to block us.

746
00:31:47,639 --> 00:31:48,360
Tinghui,

747
00:31:48,360 --> 00:31:49,479
you're too good to me.

748
00:31:49,479 --> 00:31:50,560
Meeting you in this life

749
00:31:50,560 --> 00:31:52,119
is my blessing.

750
00:31:53,760 --> 00:31:54,760
There are people watching.

751
00:32:02,639 --> 00:32:03,560
[Xiang,]

752
00:32:04,840 --> 00:32:05,719
[I've brought you]

753
00:32:05,719 --> 00:32:07,280
[your favorite apricot cakes.]

754
00:32:10,399 --> 00:32:11,560
[I miss you so much.]

755
00:32:13,360 --> 00:32:15,399
[I miss you holding me in that cage,]

756
00:32:16,040 --> 00:32:17,439
[keeping each other warm.]

757
00:32:19,959 --> 00:32:21,679
[I miss you playing the flute for me,]

758
00:32:22,719 --> 00:32:23,760
[teaching me]

759
00:32:24,040 --> 00:32:26,000
[your favorite melody.]

760
00:32:28,639 --> 00:32:29,639
[In that place,]

761
00:32:29,639 --> 00:32:30,959
[though it was unbearable,]

762
00:32:32,040 --> 00:32:33,000
[with you there,]

763
00:32:34,560 --> 00:32:35,919
[I found home.]

764
00:32:39,399 --> 00:32:40,639
[Xiang.]

765
00:32:42,439 --> 00:32:44,199
[I hate that I was so weak.]

766
00:32:46,560 --> 00:32:47,600
[I hate that]

767
00:32:47,600 --> 00:32:49,159
[I couldn't protect you.]

768
00:32:57,159 --> 00:32:58,119
[Tinghui,]

769
00:32:59,560 --> 00:33:01,360
[you must escape,]

770
00:33:02,760 --> 00:33:04,040
[as far as you can.]

771
00:33:04,800 --> 00:33:05,840
[Xiang,]

772
00:33:06,840 --> 00:33:07,919
[hold on.]

773
00:33:08,600 --> 00:33:10,320
[We can get out of here.]

774
00:33:10,719 --> 00:33:12,520
[We can survive.]

775
00:33:47,399 --> 00:33:48,360
[Xiang?]

776
00:33:50,560 --> 00:33:51,520
[Xiang?]

777
00:33:54,119 --> 00:33:55,320
[Xiang!]

778
00:33:57,479 --> 00:33:58,719
[Xiang!]

779
00:34:00,119 --> 00:34:02,080
[Xiang, say something!]

780
00:34:02,320 --> 00:34:03,520
[Xiang!]

781
00:34:05,719 --> 00:34:08,679
[Are you okay? Don't scare me.]

782
00:34:09,479 --> 00:34:10,919
[Xiang!]

783
00:34:17,399 --> 00:34:19,200
[Hold on, Xiang!]

784
00:34:51,680 --> 00:34:53,360
[Little wretch!]

785
00:35:08,720 --> 00:35:10,200
[How dare you touch me!]

786
00:35:10,999 --> 00:35:12,399
[You two can die together!]

787
00:35:14,919 --> 00:35:15,800
[Take her out.]

788
00:36:16,599 --> 00:36:17,640
[Xiang!]

789
00:36:19,240 --> 00:36:20,559
Shazhou is not

790
00:36:21,680 --> 00:36:23,479
what it once was.

791
00:36:25,240 --> 00:36:26,240
Those villains

792
00:36:26,959 --> 00:36:28,640
have finally faced their retribution.

793
00:36:34,200 --> 00:36:34,919
Xiang,

794
00:36:36,760 --> 00:36:38,160
I have never forgotten

795
00:36:39,479 --> 00:36:40,800
our promise.

796
00:36:46,919 --> 00:36:47,479
Look.

797
00:36:49,320 --> 00:36:50,599
I studied at the women's academy,

798
00:36:51,599 --> 00:36:52,720
passed the provincial exam,

799
00:36:53,479 --> 00:36:54,640
and am about to head to the capital

800
00:36:54,640 --> 00:36:55,879
for the metropolitan exam.

801
00:36:57,559 --> 00:36:59,720
They say the palace walls there are high

802
00:37:00,120 --> 00:37:01,519
and the halls vast,

803
00:37:02,200 --> 00:37:03,439
but surely there is a place

804
00:37:04,760 --> 00:37:06,879
that can hold our shared dream.

805
00:37:16,280 --> 00:37:18,999
I will step into that sovereign hall.

806
00:37:20,760 --> 00:37:22,760
I will make myself strong.

807
00:37:26,640 --> 00:37:28,079
I will protect Fuzhi.

808
00:37:30,720 --> 00:37:31,720
I will protect

809
00:37:31,720 --> 00:37:32,919
those beside me.

810
00:37:36,200 --> 00:37:37,479
I will make it so that

811
00:37:38,599 --> 00:37:39,959
no one in this world

812
00:37:39,959 --> 00:37:41,439
can trample on another's life at will.

813
00:37:45,479 --> 00:37:46,680
I will let the light

814
00:37:47,320 --> 00:37:48,879
shine on people

815
00:37:52,160 --> 00:37:54,360
like you and like me.

816
00:37:57,959 --> 00:37:58,720
[Tinghui,]

817
00:38:00,280 --> 00:38:02,160
[walk toward the light.]

818
00:38:03,919 --> 00:38:05,680
[You must live.]

819
00:38:17,399 --> 00:38:18,039
Xiang.

820
00:38:19,160 --> 00:38:20,320
Going to Jingdu,

821
00:38:21,079 --> 00:38:22,959
I'll be away long.

822
00:38:24,079 --> 00:38:25,280
If you miss me,

823
00:38:26,720 --> 00:38:28,720
come in my dreams.

824
00:38:41,479 --> 00:38:42,399
I hear Jingdu

825
00:38:42,399 --> 00:38:43,399
is damp,

826
00:38:43,399 --> 00:38:44,160
so I brought you

827
00:38:44,160 --> 00:38:45,280
this rhino horn pillow for moisture.

828
00:38:46,240 --> 00:38:46,959
Fuzhi,

829
00:38:47,320 --> 00:38:48,200
are you coming for the exam

830
00:38:48,200 --> 00:38:49,079
or moving house?

831
00:38:49,399 --> 00:38:50,360
Tinghui,

832
00:38:50,479 --> 00:38:51,280
we're

833
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:52,479
strangers in Jingdu.

834
00:38:52,479 --> 00:38:53,240
I'll make sure you're

835
00:38:53,240 --> 00:38:54,919
comfortable in every way.

836
00:38:55,200 --> 00:38:55,919
Meng Tinghui,

837
00:38:55,919 --> 00:38:56,760
pack up,

838
00:38:56,760 --> 00:38:57,640
time to go.

839
00:38:57,959 --> 00:38:59,079
Such a grand send-off.

840
00:38:59,479 --> 00:39:00,280
Aren't you afraid of

841
00:39:00,280 --> 00:39:01,439
bandits on the road?

842
00:39:01,439 --> 00:39:03,039
We have imperial protection.

843
00:39:04,079 --> 00:39:05,879
No bandit would dare touch

844
00:39:05,879 --> 00:39:06,439
a scholar

845
00:39:06,439 --> 00:39:07,760
heading to the capital.

846
00:39:08,079 --> 00:39:08,879
I will see

847
00:39:08,879 --> 00:39:10,120
my dearest Tinghui

848
00:39:10,120 --> 00:39:11,760
leave Shazhou in style.

849
00:39:11,760 --> 00:39:12,640
But it's a long journey...

850
00:39:12,640 --> 00:39:13,919
Don't worry.

851
00:39:13,959 --> 00:39:14,959
Every prefecture along the way

852
00:39:14,959 --> 00:39:15,919
will open doors

853
00:39:15,919 --> 00:39:17,120
for a provincial scholar.

854
00:39:17,120 --> 00:39:18,680
We'll have smooth sailing all the way.

855
00:39:22,800 --> 00:39:25,320
Jingdu, here we come!

856
00:39:25,320 --> 00:39:27,959
Here we come!

857
00:39:35,840 --> 00:39:36,840
Come back safe.

858
00:39:53,599 --> 00:39:54,160
Your Majesty.

859
00:39:55,879 --> 00:39:57,240
Here's the booster you've been waiting for.

860
00:39:58,640 --> 00:39:59,360
Booster?

861
00:40:01,599 --> 00:40:02,959
This list of provincial scholars.

862
00:40:02,959 --> 00:40:03,680
Isn't that the booster

863
00:40:03,680 --> 00:40:05,120
to break Chancellor Xu's grip?

864
00:40:08,680 --> 00:40:09,439
Good.

865
00:40:09,919 --> 00:40:11,959
The top scholar is Shen Zhili.

866
00:40:12,959 --> 00:40:14,160
One of our Shen clan.

867
00:40:14,160 --> 00:40:14,959
That's only natural.

868
00:40:15,039 --> 00:40:16,399
You got in by favor, she passed on merit.

869
00:40:16,559 --> 00:40:17,840
You still dare compare?

870
00:40:18,360 --> 00:40:19,160
Exactly.

871
00:40:20,479 --> 00:40:21,479
Shut it.

